		<div id="INFO_WRAP2">
			<div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-8 col-md-push-4 col-lg-8 eatures-box wow fadeInDown animated"
				id="INFO_BPHOTO2">
				<div class="row PHOTOBG2">
					<!-- <img src="images/pic_16.jpg" width="100%"> -->
				</div>
			</div>


			<div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-4 col-md-pull-8 col-lg-4 FRANK_BTN eatures-box wow fadeInDown animated">
				<div class="row">


					<div class="INFO2" style="padding:5%;">
						<ul>
							<li>
								<h4 class="ENTITLE">Steak</h4>
							</li>
							<li>
								<h4 class="CHTITLE">觸動味蕾與心靈的感動!</h4>
							</li>
						</ul>
						<div role="tabpanel">
							<!-- 標籤面板：標籤區 -->
							<ul class="nav nav-tabs" role="tablist">
								<li role="presentation" class="active">
									<a href="#tab3" aria-controls="tab1" role="tab" data-toggle="tab">中文</a>
								</li>
								<li role="presentation">
									<a href="#tab4" aria-controls="tab2" role="tab" data-toggle="tab">English</a>
								</li>

							</ul>

							<!-- 標籤面板：內容區 -->
							<div class="tab-content">
								<div role="tabpanel" class="tab-pane active" id="tab3">
									<p>
										艾朋牛排餐酒館引進西班牙豪華Josper木炭烤箱，全程以果木燻烤，專業主廚依肉質不同來控制火侯，在慢火微熟中燻烤出特級優質的煙燻牛排，讓人由口入心，感受到一股原木芳香回繞唇齒的風味，成功打動每吋挑剔味蕾，享用鮮嫩牛排層次風采。
									</p>

									<p>
										煙燻牛排在全臺灣為極少有的烹飪工法，甚少在其他餐廳能夠品嚐到，艾朋為實踐對美食極致要求並追求讓賓客有更臻完美的感動，透過特制訂做的百萬煙燻及低溫烤箱爐具，並融合低溫烹調技術，除了將牛肉的鮮甜柔嫩和天然原木芬芳融合為一體，更增加保留牛肉美味的鮮甜肉汁，提升至更高的境界。
									</p>


								</div>
								<div role="tabpanel" class="tab-pane" id="tab4">
									<p>À Point introduced Josper charcoal oven from Spain for our steaks. The meat is smoked with berry
										woods and the temperature attended carefully by our Chef to produce juicy, subtle smoke flavored
										steaks. Enjoy different levels of tastes in our steaks and be moved from your mouth to heart.</p>
								</div>

							</div>
						</div>
						<!--tabpane1-->

					</div>
					<!--info-->
					<div class="BOX_TXT2">
						<div class="BTN_MORE">
							<a href="gourmet.asp">
								<div class="BTN">美食饗宴 FOOD MENU</div>
