									<h4 class="ENTITLE">Drinks</h4>
									<p>匯集整合繽紛鮮果，酸甜口感舞動舌尖上的芭蕾。</p>

									<h4 class="ENTITLE">Cocktail</h4>

									<p>除了午晚餐時段，更在晚上21:30以後供應各式宵夜小點與調酒，舒服自在的環境，是夜貓族們悠閒聚會放鬆壓力的好地方。</p>

									<h4 class="ENTITLE">Coffee</h4>
									<p>採用來自於義大利西西里島，Miscela　D'Oro正統南義咖啡精選自Arabica 及 Robusta 咖啡豆焙炒而成，調配出香氣濃郁，回甘度極佳的口感。</p>

								</div>
								<div role="tabpanel" class="tab-pane" id="tab6">
									<h4 class="ENTITLE">Drinks</h4>
									<p>With the collection and mixture of a variety of fresh fruits, it leaves a sweet-sour dancing
										sensation at the tip of the tongue.</p>

									<h4 class="ENTITLE">Cocktail</h4>

									<p>Aside from lunch and supper time, À Point also serves snacks and cocktails after 9:30pm in a cozy
										environment, perfect for night owls for gathering and relaxation.</p>

									<h4 class="ENTITLE">Coffee</h4>
									<p>Introduced from Southern Italy, the authentic coffee Miscela D'oro from Sicily is roasted with the
										combination of Arabica and Robusta beans, which imparts aromatic and savory taste.</p>

								</div>

